[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Tasks
OPTIONS:
  VIEW_STYLE: Table

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @requirement

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
Tasks, recurrence and completion. UIDs: REQ-BE-030 .. 039.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-030
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Task contents
STATEMENT: >>>
A task shall have a title, an optional description, a person, a date and an icon.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-031
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Recurrence
STATEMENT: >>>
Tasks and agenda items shall support the repeat types once, daily, weekly, every two weeks and selected weekdays, with an optional end date. A repeating item shall not occur before its start date or after its end date.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-032
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Completion per occurrence
STATEMENT: >>>
Completing a repeating task shall mark only the occurrence on the given date as done.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-BE-033
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Move and reorder
STATEMENT: >>>
Task managers shall be able to move a task to another date and to set the order of tasks within a day.
<<<
